\fs48 \cf2 Insights\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
When working with reflection, you must use parameterized types in the square parameter brackets for calls that use reflection features, such as 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 show_type[]()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 . These elements can be concrete types like 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 MyStruct
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  or generic type parameters like 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 T
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 .\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
This example uses a 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 T: AnyType
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  parameter for the 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 show_type[]()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  function. This is the least restrictive constraint and allows the function to work with any type passed at the call site.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reflection functions are themselves parameterized. That means you do not call 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 foo()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 . You call 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 foo[T]()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  to reflect on a type.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
All processing of reflected information happens at compile time. For that reason, these reflection examples use {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/manual/metaprogramming/comptime-evaluation/#comptime-for"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb14 \ul \ulc5 comptime for}} and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/manual/metaprogramming/comptime-evaluation/#comptime-if"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb14 \ul \ulc5 comptime if}}.\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
In this example, 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 comptime for
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  allows the loop index to be used across iterations.\
\ls5\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Later examples show 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb14 comptime if
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

